# This directory holds compliance evidence for App Store / Play screening:
# bank statements, the company registry extract, the VAT certificate, and a
# README cataloguing them by account number and tax ID.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Ignore everything in here except this file — a
# `git add -A` elsewhere in the tree must never be able to sweep any of it in.
# That is not hypothetical: the README was committed exactly that way and had to
# be removed again.
*
!.gitignore
